**Decision:** No conflict. Limited informal advisory on DPDP positioning and India GTM framing is permissible now. Active consulting arrangement (equity or retainer) deferred to post-May 2027 for clean separation from serving status.

**Rationale:** PrivacyWeave operates entirely in commercial data governance. The product is directly relevant to DPDP Act 2023 compliance — an area within VV's academic research and advisory positioning. No SCOMET, no iDEX, no defence procurement exposure.

